<title>USA: CFTC sees quick action on CBOT delivery proposal.</title>
<headline>CFTC sees quick action on CBOT delivery proposal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commodity Futures Trading Commission chief Brooksley Born said Monday the agency planned to act quickly after the membership of the Chicago Board of Trade votes on April 15 on proposed changes for delivery of its corn and soybean contracts.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to be able to act on that proposal fairly quickly,&quot; Born said in response to a question following her speech at an agricultural policy conference.</p>
</text>
